# ── Runtime data ────────────────────────────────────────
# Everything the app and the evaluation write: uploaded documents, ChromaDB, MLflow runs, the evaluation index
data/
# The documents of the evaluation set (the books are copyrighted); also ignores a leftover documents/ at the root
documents/
# The same data in the folders used before data/ existed, still ignored while they exist on a machine
vector_db/
mlruns/
mlflow_data/

# ── Generated files ─────────────────────────────────────
# Regenerate with `uv run python -m eval.evaluate`
eval/last_report.md
*.log

